; Magic Missile, The Archmage's opener (.ai/protagonist.md). Pure Arcane since 2026-11-02; NERFED 2026-11-03 (Eric:
; "Nerf magic missile") from 10 every 0.5 s to 12 every 0.8 s. The cadence is the nerf: every cast charges Arcane
; Explosion, and a dart every half second set it off nearly nonstop; damage alone (10 -> 8, -> 7) did not move it.

; STARTING RANGE (Eric, 2026-11-04: "Arcane missile and chain lightning range starts too big"): 500 reached past
; the top and bottom of a PC screen (about 425 px from the player at zoom 0.85), so a level 1 dart flew at
; things the player could not see. 340 starts inside it and the reach grows +40 at levels 3 and 7, to 420.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_43iml")
Tagline = "Darts at the nearest enemy."
Id = "magic_missile"
Name = "Magic Missile"
CurrentLevel = 1
MaxLevel = 8
BaseDamage = 12
BaseCooldown = 0.8
BaseProjectileCount = 1
BaseRange = 340.0
LevelUpgrades = Array[ExtResource("2_5s5xv")]([SubResource("Resource_mm_lvl2"), SubResource("Resource_mm_lvl3"), SubResource("Resource_mm_lvl5"), SubResource("Resource_mm_lvl7")])
Description = "Fires a fast projectile at nearby enemies."
Icon = ExtResource("3_icon")
ElementWeights = {
"Arcane": 1
}
